r></tbody></table></div><div id=\"tOoLtIp02\" style=\"position:absolute;z-index:1010;left:0px;top:0px;width:300px;visibility:hidden;-moz-opacity:1;\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#000040\" style=\"background:#000040;\" width=\"300\"><tbody><tr><td><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"3\" cellspacing=\"1\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr><td bgcolor=\"#f0f0ff\" style=\"text-align:left;padding:3px;\" align=\"left\"><font color=\"#000066\" face=\"arial,helvetica,sans-serif\" style=\"color:#000066;font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:normal;\">The Simplest Lowpass Filter</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div id=\"tOoLtIp01\" style=\"position:absolute;z-index:1010;left:0px;top:0px;width:300px;visibility:hidden;-moz-opacity:1;\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#000040\" style=\"background:#000040;\" width=\"300\"><tbody><tr><td><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"3\" cellspacing=\"1\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr><td bgcolor=\"#f0f0ff\" style=\"text-align:left;padding:3px;\" align=\"left\"><font color=\"#000066\" face=\"arial,helvetica,sans-serif\" style=\"color:#000066;font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:normal;\">The Simplest Lowpass Filter</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div id=\"tOoLtIp00\" style=\"position:absolute;z-index:1010;left:0px;top:0px;width:300px;visibility:hidden;-moz-opacity:1;\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#000040\" style=\"background:#000040;\" width=\"300\"><tbody><tr><td><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"3\" cellspacing=\"1\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr><td bgcolor=\"#f0f0ff\" style=\"text-align:left;padding:3px;\" align=\"left\"><font color=\"#000066\" face=\"arial,helvetica,sans-serif\" style=\"color:#000066;font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:normal;\">What is a Filter?</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<!--Navigation Panel-->\n<strong>\n<a name=\"tex2html770\" href=\"https://ccrma.stanford.edu/~jos/filters/What_Filter.html\">Next</a> &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n<a name=\"tex2html760\" href=\"https://ccrma.stanford.edu/~jos/filters/Simplest_Lowpass_Filter.html\">Prev</a> &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n<a name=\"tex2html766\" href=\"https://ccrma.stanford.edu/~jos/filters/Simplest_Lowpass_Filter.html\">Up</a> &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n<a href=\"https://ccrma.stanford.edu/%7Ejos/filters/filters.html\">Top</a> \n\t\t&nbsp;|&nbsp;\n <a name=\"tex2html768\" href=\"https://ccrma.stanford.edu/~jos/filters/Index_this_Document.html\">Index</a> &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n<a href=\"https://ccrma.stanford.edu/~jos/GlobalJOSIndex.html\">JOS Index</a> &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n <a href=\"https://ccrma.stanford.edu/~jos/pubs.html\">JOS Pubs</a> &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n<a href=\"https://ccrma.stanford.edu/%7Ejos\">JOS Home</a> &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n<a href=\"https://ccrma.stanford.edu/~jos/index.html#searchform\">Search</a>\n</strong>\n<hr>\n\n<!--End of Navigation Panel-->\n\n<h2><a name=\"SECTION00210000000000000000\">\nIntroduction</a>\n</h2>\n\n<p>\nMusicians have been using <a href=\"https://ccrma.stanford.edu/~jos/filters/What_Filter.html\">filters</a> for thousands of years to shape the\nsounds of their art in various ways. For example, the evolution of the\nphysical dimensions of the violin constitutes an evolution in <a href=\"http://www.circuitsage.com/filter.html\">filter\ndesign</a>. The choice of wood, the shape of the cutouts, the <a href=\"http://aleph0.clarku.edu/~djoyce/java/elements/elements.html\">geometry</a> of\nthe bridge, and everything that affects resonance all have a bearing\non how the violin <a href=\"https://ccrma.stanford.edu/~jos/pasp/Parallel_Body_Filterbank_Design.html\">body filters</a> the <a href=\"http://ccrma.stanford.edu/~jos/filters/Definition_Signal.html\">signal</a> induced at the bridge by the\n<a href=\"https://ccrma.stanford.edu/~jos/pasp/Ideal_Vibrating_String.html\">vibrating strings</a>. Once a sound is airborne there is yet more\nfiltering performed by the listening environment, by the pinnae of the\near, and by idiosyncrasies of the <a href=\"https://ccrma.stanford.edu/CCRMA/Courses/152/hearing.html\">hearing</a> process.\n\n</p><p>\n<br></p><hr>\n<!--Table of Child-Links-->\n<a name=\"CHILD_LINKS\"><strong>Subsections</strong></a>\n\n<ul>\n<li><a name=\"tex2html771\" href=\"https://ccrma.stanford.edu/~jos/filters/What_Filter.html\">What is a Filter?</a>\n</li><li><a name=\"tex2html772\" href=\"https://ccrma.stanford.edu/~jos/filters/Why_learn_about_filters.html\">Why learn about filters?</a>\n</li></ul>\n<!--End of Table of Child-Links-->\n<hr>\n<!--Navigation Panel--><strong>\n<a name=\"tex2html770\" href=\"https://ccrma.stanford.edu/~jos/filters/What_Filter.html\">Next</a> &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n<a name=\"tex2html760\" href=\"https://ccrma.stanford.edu/~jos/filters/Simplest_Lowpass_Filter.html\">Prev</a> &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n<a name=\"tex2html766\" href=\"https://ccrma.stanford.edu/~jos/filters/Simplest_Lowpass_Filter.html\">Up</a> &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n<a href=\"https://ccrma.stanford.edu/%7Ejos/filters/filters.html\">Top</a> \n\t\t&nbsp;|&nbsp;\n <a name=\"tex2html768\" href=\"https://ccrma.stanford.edu/~jos/filters/Index_this_Document.html\">Index</a> &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n<a href=\"https://ccrma.stanford.edu/~jos/GlobalJOSIndex.html\">JOS Index</a> &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n <a href=\"https://ccrma.stanford.edu/~jos/pubs.html\">JOS Pubs</a> &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n<a href=\"https://ccrma.stanford.edu/%7Ejos\">JOS Home</a> &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n<a href=\"https://ccrma.stanford.edu/~jos/index.html#searchform\">Search</a>\n</strong>\n<!--End of Navigation Panel-->\n<address>\n<hr><a href=\"https://ccrma.stanford.edu/~jos/filters/filters-citation.html\">[How to cite this work]</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://ccrma.stanford.edu/~jos/filters/filters-hardcopy.html\">[Order a printed hardcopy]</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"mailto:jos@ccrma.stanford.edu?subject=Introduction%20to%20Digital%20Filters%20with%20Audio%20Applications&amp;body=[Please%20paste%20the%20page%20URL%20here%20and%20then%20comment.]\">[Comment on this page via email]</a><br><hr><h5>``<a href=\"https://ccrma.stanford.edu/%7Ejos/filters/\">Introduction to Digital Filters with Audio Applications</a>'',\n by <a href=\"https://ccrma.stanford.edu/%7Ejos/\"> Julius O. Smith III</a>,\n (September 2007 Edition)<br>\nCopyright \u00a9 <i>2026-03-17</i> by <a href=\"https://ccrma.stanford.edu/%7Ejos/\"> Julius O. Smith III</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://ccrma.stanford.edu/\">\n\tCenter for Computer Research in Music and Acoustics (CCRMA),</a>\n&nbsp;\n<a href=\"http://www.stanford.edu/\"> Stanford University</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://ccrma.stanford.edu/\">\n\t<img align=\"MIDDLE\" src=\"https://ccrma.stanford.edu/%7Ejos/icons/CCRMALogoSmall.gif\" alt=\"CCRMA\">\n</a>\n</h5>\n\n\n</address>\n<!-- COURSE-INJECT -->\n\n\n\n<div class=\"course-sidebar\">\n      <button class=\"course-sidebar-toggle\" aria-label=\"Toggle sidebar\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n          <path d=\"M15 18l-6-6 6-6\"></path>\n        </svg>\n      </button>\n      <div class=\"course-sidebar-header\">\n        <h3>SASP Course</h3>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"course-sidebar-tabs\">\n        <button class=\"course-sidebar-tab active\" data-tab=\"progress\">Progress</button>\n        <button class=\"course-sidebar-tab\" data-tab=\"exercises\">Exercises</button>\n        <button class=\"course-sidebar-tab\" data-tab=\"help\">Help</button>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"course-sidebar-content\">\n        <div class=\"course-tab-panel\" data-panel=\"progress\">\n          \n      <div class=\"course-progress\">\n        <div class=\"course-progress-label\"></div>\n        <div class=\"course-progress-bar\">\n          <div class=\"course-progress-fill\" style=\"width: 0%\"></div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"margin-top: 4px; font-size: 11px; color: var(--